## Get auth token
## Admin Token: Authorization:
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

// ТЕСТЫ НА ВАЛИДАЦИЮ USERNAME И PASSWORD ДЛЯ АДМИНА

### Positive test: Admin can create new user with correct data
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "kate1920",
  "password": "kate1998",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Negative test: Admin can`t create new user with blank username
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "{{$random.uuid}}",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Negative test: Admin can`t create new user with username 2 characters
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "{{$random.uuid}}",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Negative test: Admin can`t create new user with username 16 characters
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "abcdefghijklmnop",
  "password": "{{$random.uuid}}",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Negative test: Admin can`t create new user with username contains $%^&*()@# characters
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "$%^&*()@#",
  "password": "{{$random.uuid}}",
  "role": "USER"
}

