// ТЕСТЫ НА ВАЛИДАЦИЮ ПОЛЯ name

### Positive: Create user with valid name (testuser1 - для будущих тестов)
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Negative: Create user with name containing only one word
