GET http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/acc-123/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Negative: User tries to view transactions of someone else's account
GET http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/someone-elses-acc/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

